SEQUENCE:1
DTSTAMP:20260913T043407Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20260914T083000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20260914T110000
SUMMARY:Duke Forest Figure Eight Hike
DESCRIPTION:Triangle Hiking and Outdoors Group\n**Duke Forrest closes duri
 ng weekdays from September 21 to December 11. This will be the last Figure
  Eight for a while.**\n\nWe will start at Gate 26 on Whitfield Road (see m
 ap and How to Find Us). We will hike down to New Hope Creek and follow the
  south side of the creek to the NEW Bridge. We will cross and continue on 
 the Concrete Bridge Trail\, the Wooden Bridge Trail and then along New Hop
 e Creek back to the new bridge. We will cross it and continue on Concrete 
 Bridge FT to the Gate 25 to Gate 26 connector and return to the cars.\n\nT
 he hike is about 6.5 miles long. Half is on fire trails (= multiuse trails
 ) and hilly but easy. The part along New Hope Creek is rocky and rooty wit
 h scrambling over rocks.\n\nWe will maintain a pace of about 3 miles per h
 our and take short breaks as needed. Bring water and snacks.\n\nBy partici
 pating in this event\, you agree to the terms below:\n\nTRIP PARTICIPANT W
 AIVER OF LIABILITY I fully realize that this activity involves a risk of p
 ersonal injury\, property damage\, or loss of my person or property. I her
 eby for myself\, my heirs\, executors and administrators\, and same for pe
 rsons with whom are in my party\, waive and release any claims or rights a
 gainst Triangle Hiking & Outdoors Group (THOG)\, all of its owners and coo
 rdinators for any and all injury\, damages or loss to my person or propert
 y incurred during this activity. I also understand that THOG organizers ar
 e not required\, nor should it be assumed that they are CPR/First Aid/Wild
 erness Survival Certified and I am responsible for my own personal safety.
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/adventures/events/316482321/
STATUS:CONFIRMED
CREATED:20260909T121737Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260909T121737Z
CLASS:PUBLIC
END:VEVENT
