 ndersfordemocracy/" target="_blank">https://www.mobilize.us/engagedefender
 sfordemocracy/</a></p><p><a href="https://www.mobilize.us/engagedefendersf
 ordemocracy/event/873284/">https://www.mobilize.us/engagedefendersfordemoc
 racy/event/873284/</a> </p></span><u></u><u></u><br><u></u>
