SUMMARY:Concert Truck
DESCRIPTION:Launched in 2016 and now rolling into Durham\, this unique init
 iative is redefining live music access. At its core is a standard 16-foot 
 box truck\, brilliantly transformed into a fully equipped\, mobile concert
  hall\, complete with professional sound\, lighting\, and a grand piano. 
 The Concert Truck will deliver world-class artists and exceptional musical
  performances to thousands of students at six Durham Public Schools before
  cozying up to the Patio at American Tobacco Campus just outside Parker an
 d Otis. Come enjoy this free show\, open to the public!
