DESCRIPTION:Ever been curious about mushrooms\, those weird and wild organi
 sms that unexpectedly pop out of the ground? This program is for you! This
  short\, moderate hike will introduce participants to the fungus family\, 
 and everyone will have a chance to find living specimens and examine them 
 closely.\n\nAttendees are welcome to bring in samples of mushrooms from th
 eir own property. Place any samples in a paper bag\, and do not eat any mu
 shrooms found\, as they may be poisonous.\n\nThe hike will begin from the 
 Linville Gorge Overlook parking lot\, which is just inside the Paddy's Cre
 ek Access's entrance gate on the right.\n\nPlease note: collecting mushroo
 ms is prohibited in North Carolina State Parks. There will be no foray as 
 part of this program.
GEO:35.760718;-81.882276
