 activities and live birds brought to you by Owls Roost Wildlife Education\
 , Forsyth Audubon\, local library staff\, and of course park educators and
  rangers! Meet live hawks\, enjoy games and activities\, get birdwatching 
 tips from the pros\, and join the official Pilot Mountain State Park Annua
 l Hawk Count!
