DESCRIPTION:🥣🌈QUEER SOUP NIGHT IS BACK\, for our 3rd event.<br><br>C
 ome as you are. Come hungry. Come curious. Come in your best Pride attire 
 or what makes you feel comfy.. There’s no pressure.<br><br>Join us for a
 n evening of soup\, music\, art\, tarot\, astrology\, and connection as we
  gather around food and support LGBTQ+ community care.<br><br>This Queer S
 oup Night\, we’re proud to support the LGBTQ Center of Durham and their 
 Pride Campaign for $50K in 2026. Funds raised will support the Center’s 
 work to create an authentic\, accessible Pride and provide year-round reso
 urces for our LGBTQ+ community. We’re also helping raise awareness and s
 upport for the Center’s Food Pantry and the essential resources it provi
 des. <a href="https://www.instagram.com/pridedurhamnc/">@pridedurhamnc</a
 > <a href="https://www.instagram.com/lgbtqdurham/">@lgbtqdurham</a><br><b
 r>✨ Suggested donation: $5–$20<br>💜 No one turned away for lack of 
 funds<br>💵 Cash + Venmo accepted at the event<br><br>👩🏽‍🍳Fea
 turing Chef Danica Lee of <a href="https://www.instagram.com/dlxkitchen/"
 >@dlxkitchen</a><br><br>And there’s more to come! 🎨 Art\, 🔮 Tarot 
 &amp\; ✨ Astrology details will be announced soon.<br><br>📅 Tuesday\,
  September\, 22nd<br>🕡 Doors open at 6:30 PM<br>📍 114 Hunt Street\, 
 Durham\, NC<br>⏰ Event: 6:30–8:30 PM<br><br>Come share a bowl. Meet so
 meone new. Support community.<br><br>♿Accessibility information will be 
 shared in a separate post.<br><br>Masks 😷 are encouraged.
LAST-MODIFIED:20260908T210310Z
LOCATION:114 - whole building
