DESCRIPTION:We are excited to host our fourth Data Science Day at the Carol
 ina Club on Thursday\, Sept. 24 from 8:30 a.m. to 4 p.m. This annual event
  brings together faculty\, staff and student researchers from North Caroli
 na colleges and universities to celebrate data science research and collab
 oration. This year’s theme\, Emerging Directions in Data Science\, highl
 ights the evolving methods\, tools and applications shaping the future of 
 the field. We invite the Carolina community to share work that reflects ne
 w trajectories in data‑driven research and innovation.\n\n \n\nThis even
 t is free but registration is required. Registrants are required to use th
 eir “.edu” email addresses.\n\n \n\nRegister online. \n\nIf you are a 
 UNC-Chapel Hill student and would like CLE credit\, register at Heel Life.
GEO:35.906966;-79.045573
LOCATION:Carolina Club\, Alumni Hall
SUMMARY:Data Science Day
