DESCRIPTION:Join a Park Ranger and discover what it's like to track an anim
 al. We will start at our historic bathhouse and then hike around our lake.
  The trail is an easy 1-mile loop. This program is for children ages 5-12 
 and their families\, but all are welcome. Be sure to bring water\, good sh
 oes for hiking\, and weather-appropriate clothing. Registration is require
 d – please email Jackson.perry@ncparks.gov.
GEO:36.395044;-80.266541
LOCATION:Hanging Rock State Park\, Lake Bathhouse 
SUMMARY:Animal Tracks
