DESCRIPTION:The Cross Creek Colonial Ball\n\nStep into the 18th century for
  a great cause! Join us at the The Cross Creek Colonial Ball and help supp
 ort the Holy Trinity Episcopal Food Pantry. Dance\, history\, and communit
 y coming together to make a difference.\n\nGet ready for a night of fun an
 d history at the The Cross Creek Colonial Ball! This in-person event bring
 s together friends and history buffs to dance and celebrate colonial times
 . Dress up\, step back in time\, and enjoy an evening filled with historic
  tunes\, great company\, and live music. Don't miss out on this awesome ch
 ance to experience a bit of the past in a lively\, welcoming atmosphere! L
 earn more at https://fayhistoricdance.wixsite.com/cccball.  All proceeds b
 enefit the Holy Trinity Episcopal Church Food Pantry.\n\nTickets can be pu
 rchased through EventBrite
GEO:35.053476;-78.907472
