DTEND:20260927T170000Z
DESCRIPTION:Join a Chimney Rock State Park Ranger on Sunday\, September 27t
 h\, from 11:00 AM to 1:00 PM at the Old Gatehouse Entrance to the park to 
 celebrate and reflect on the resilience of Chimney Rock State Park and our
  community on the anniversary of Hurricane Helene.\n\nRanger staff will sh
 are stories of the park’s response\, recovery\, and rebuilding\, celebra
 ting the strength and determination that have carried Chimney Rock State P
 ark forward.\n\nStaff will also present a "Flags of Freedom and Resilience
 " program and discuss America’s 250th anniversary and the flags of our s
 tate and Nation.\n\nJoin us as we celebrate history\, freedom\, resilience
 \, and recovery! Make your own "flag of resilience" at the craft table.
GEO:35.439636;-82.248616
LOCATION:Historic Chimney Rock Park Gatehouse
SUMMARY:Flags of Resilience and Freedom
URL;VALUE=URI:https://events.dncr.nc.gov/event/flags-of-resilience-and-free
 dom
