DESCRIPTION:Join a Park Ranger for a canoe paddle on our 12-acre lake. Lear
 n the basics of canoeing\, why boating safety is important\, and what make
 s our lake special. While there is no swimming portion during this program
 \, you will likely get splashed\, so be sure to wear appropriate clothing.
  Bring water and sunscreen. This program is for Middle and High Schoolers.
  Any participants under 16 must be accompanied by an adult. Registration i
 s required and there is limited space – please email Jackson.perry@ncpar
 ks.gov  to register. This program is weather dependent.
