X-SOURCE-ID:gcal_lgbtqcenterofdurham_org_qb71v8n48d0a304sq7dtm89f84
SUMMARY:Get Shit Done - SQSN - Special Guest - Virtual Only
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20260929T173000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20260929T183000
DTSTAMP:20260913T043357Z
UID:7s87dr1amic62cjmlkbm0di463@google.com
RECURRENCE-ID;TZID=America/New_York:20260929T173000
SEQUENCE:0
CREATED:20260909T172705Z
DESCRIPTION:<b>This event is intended for Queer and/or Trans survivors:</b
 ><br><br>Some of the biggest barriers to survivor safety are finance relat
 ed. While we do our best to put cash directly into survivors hands\, in ta
 ndem\, we thought it would be awesome to create a body doubling/coworking 
 space where we can support each other in sifting through all the shit that
  goes into getting financial stable. And offer relevant financial resource
 s as we find them!<br><br>That’s why we host our “Get Shit Done” eve
 nings. This special date will feature a special guest.  ( <a href="https
 ://forms.gle/oJrgDoueQ6wCXKu16" target="_blank"><u>register </u></a>or em
 ail <a href="mailto:advocate@lgbtqcenterofdurham.org" target="_blank"><u>
 advocate@lgbtqcenterofdurham.org</u></a> for the virtual link). <br><br>
 If you or someone you know is a money expert who wants to share their know
 ledge with queer/trans survivors\, please reach out!
LAST-MODIFIED:20260909T172705Z
LOCATION:Virtual Only
STATUS:CONFIRMED
TRANSP:OPAQUE
X-SOURCE:LGBTQ Center of Durham
END:VEVENT
