DESCRIPTION:<p>Every Wednesday at 5:45pm<br>From BURIAL at Transfer Co<br>
 Steady riding Ø21-22mph</p><p>Notes:<br>Call out turns and debris\, look 
 out for each other<br>Not a no drop ride\, skip pulls to stay on as needed
