DESCRIPTION:The Alfred Moore Chapter\, National Society Daughters of the Am
 erican Revolution (NSDAR)\, invites the community to attend the dedication
  and unveiling of an America 250! Revolutionary War Patriots Marker.\n\nTh
 e marker will be placed on the courthouse grounds adjacent to the Charters
  of Freedom and will serve as a permanent tribute to the men and women who
 se courage\, sacrifice\, and service helped secure American independence.\
 n\nThe dedication is part of the National Society Daughters of the America
 n Revolution’s nationwide commemoration of the 250th anniversary of the 
 United States. Through its America 250! initiatives\, DAR is honoring the 
 Patriots of the American Revolution and encouraging communities to reflect
  upon the people\, events\, and ideals that shaped the founding of our nat
 ion.
