BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE-ID:gcal_newhopeaudubon
SUMMARY:NHBA Hawk Watch Trip - Wait List Only
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261002
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261005
DTSTAMP:20260913T043452Z
UID:72fe81cgdpifshogm9vrknhiau@google.com
RECURRENCE-ID;VALUE=DATE:20261002
SEQUENCE:0
CREATED:20260725T234924Z
DESCRIPTION:<p>THIS TRIP IS FULL. If you wish to be added to the wait list
 \, contact David Anderson at <a href="mailto:d47anders@gmail.com" target
 ="_blank"><u>d47anders@gmail.com</u></a>.</p><p>New Hope Bird Alliance is 
 leading a Hawk Watch to Mahogany Rock on the Blue Ridge Parkway. This is a
  major migration route for broad-winged hawks and other raptors. We will a
 lso visit local bird sites (Stone Mt. State Park\, Doughton Park\, Mahogan
 y Rock Mt.) for warblers and other fall migrants. David Anderson\, Vern B
 othwell and Tom Driscoll will lead this trip\, which is limited to 14 part
 icipants. <br><br>A $75 donation to NHBA per person is requested. </p><p>
 Mahogany Rock is a 2-1/2 hour drive from Durham. We ask that individuals c
 arpool if possible and arrange their own accommodations. There are AirBnbs
  and cabins in the area. Local hotels include the <a href="http://www.high
 meadowsinn.com/" target="_blank">High Meadows Inn</a> in Roaring Gap\, and
  the <a href="https://www.alleghanyinn.com" target="_blank">Alleghany Inn<
 /a> in Sparta.</p><p><strong>Itinerary (subject to change):</strong><br>- 
 <span>Friday\, October 2\, 9 AM</span>\, meet at Mahogany Rock overlook (m
 ilepost 235 BRP). <br>- Saturday and Sunday\, meet <span>at 7 AM</span> 
 to bird local areas. Regroup at Mahogany rock <span>at 10 AM</span> for h
 awks (best in late morning or early afternoon). </p><p>There are places t
 o eat or to buy food in the surrounding communities.</p><p>For any questio
 ns\, please contact David Anderson at <a href="mailto:d47anders@gmail.com
 " target="_blank"><span>d47anders@gmail.com</span></a> or Tom Driscoll at 
 <a href="mailto:spttdrdshnk@yahoo.com" target="_blank"><span>spttdrdshnk@y
 ahoo.com</span></a>.</p>
LAST-MODIFIED:20260802T232808Z
STATUS:CONFIRMED
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
X-SOURCE:New Hope Bird Alliance
END:VEVENT
