DTSTAMP:20260803T151934Z
URL:https://americantobacco.co/events/fortune-feimster-takin-care-of-biscu
 its-tour/
SUMMARY:Fortune Feimster | Takin' Care of Biscuits Tour
DESCRIPTION:North Carolina native Fortune Feimster is a critically acclaime
 d comedian\, actress\, and host known for her upbeat style\, unique comedi
 c perspective\, and infectious energy. She invites audiences into her worl
 d where laughter and love reign supreme.\n\nCome enjoy her live at the DPA
 C for her "Takin' Care of Biscuits" Comedy Tour. Tickets and more info her
 e.\n\n&nbsp\;
