  them in flight! This program is free and all ages are welcome. A flashlig
 ht and comfy walking shoes are recommended.\n\nWe will be hiking a small p
 ortion of the Commissary Trail\, roughly a mile in total. Please meet at t
 he park office at the entrance of the trail. (Please note this program may
  be cancelled at any time due to weather).
