DESCRIPTION:Get ready for University Day with University Landscape Architec
 t Daniel Widis and University Archivist Nicholas Graham. They’ll discuss
  the campus landscape and what we know about it from the archival record.\
 n\nThe Library Discovery Hour Series aims to provide an inside look into t
 oday’s University Library at Carolina. Join us to discover new perspecti
 ves and delve into fascinating topics that showcase the impact of the Libr
 ary on every Tar Heel.
LOCATION:
SUMMARY:Library Discovery Hour
URL;VALUE=URI:https://calendar.unc.edu/event/library-discovery-hour-671
CATEGORIES:Lectures
END:VEVENT
