DESCRIPTION:Humanity’s oldest friend\, Elizabethans\, had a love for drin
 ks and played a significant part in their daily lives! From entertainment 
 to daily survival\, Englishmen of the past had to brew a lot of drinks to 
 keep up! Come by the EII to see what historical beer and ale were made of 
 and how it was made! 
GEO:35.910864;-75.665174
LOCATION:Roanoke Island Festival Park\, Elizabeth II
