UID:tag:localist.com\,2008:EventInstance_53578435260264
DTSTART:20261007T170000Z
DTEND:20261007T183000Z
DESCRIPTION:This workshop continues to explore methods used in creating int
 eractive visualizations and dashboards as introduced in Tableau I. Topics 
 covered in the hands-on course will include: merging data sources\, groups
  and sets\, advanced maps and interactive menus\, dashboard actions\, and 
 more!\n\n \n\nThis workshop is offered by the University Library and will 
 be led by librarian Lorin Bruckner. \n\n \n\nThis workshop is being offere
 d remotely via Zoom. Register here: https://calendar.lib.unc.edu/event/172
 36399
LOCATION:
SUMMARY:Tableau II
URL;VALUE=URI:https://calendar.unc.edu/event/tableau-ii-4963
CATEGORIES:Workshops and Classes
END:VEVENT
