UID:tag:localist.com\,2008:EventInstance_53753352654655
DTSTART:20261008T170000Z
DTEND:20261008T180000Z
DESCRIPTION:This session provides an overview of changes to the National In
 stitutes of Health (NIH) grant application requirements\, including new Co
 mmon Forms that will be required for due dates on or after January 25\, 20
 26.\n\n \n\nIn particular\, this presentation will focus on the Biosketch 
 and Current and Pending (Other) Support forms\, which will need to be comp
 leted using the SciENcv tool. It will include demonstrations of SciENcv as
  well as ORCID iD creation and linking steps. The presentation aims to pre
 pare researchers for the new NIH requirements by providing detailed instru
 ctions and resources to ensure compliance. \n\n \n\nThis program is offere
 d by the Health Sciences Library and led by Katherine Howell. It is part o
 f the Grants and Compliance and Advancing Clinical Research Skills worksho
 p tracks.
LOCATION:
SUMMARY:NIH Common Forms Requirements: Biosketch and Current and Pending (O
 ther) Support
URL;VALUE=URI:https://calendar.unc.edu/event/nih-common-forms-requirements-
 biosketch-and-current-and-pending-other-support-3785
CATEGORIES:Workshops and Classes
END:VEVENT
