BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"Calendar 1 Ics": "https://calendar.unc.edu/event/talsounds-cmm-26-27"}
X-SOURCE-ID:calendar_1_ics
X-SOURCE:UNC Chapel Hill
DTSTAMP:20260913T043501Z
UID:tag:localist.com\,2008:EventInstance_53798770537099
DTSTART:20261010T233000Z
DTEND:20261011T003000Z
DESCRIPTION:FEATURING\n\nTALsounds\n\nNatalie Chami (TALsounds) is a Canadi
 an-born Lebanese American musician and educator based in Alexandria\, VA. 
 Known for her work in drone\, ambient\, and improvisational music\, she bl
 ends vintage analog synthesizers\, operatic vocals\, and immersive atmosph
 eres into distinctive sound worlds. Chami has released music on Ba Da Bing
 \, NNA Tapes\, and Hausu Mountain\, toured across the U.S.\, Canada\, and 
 Europe\, and received coverage from Pitchfork\, The Fader\, The Washington
  Post\, and The Chicago Tribune. Her latest album\, Shift (2023)\, departs
  from her warm analog palette and explores FM and digital synthesis\, feat
 uring contributions from SWANA women in production\, art\, and photography
 . \n\nChami was founding Vocal Chair at The Chicago High School for the Ar
 ts (2009–2021)\, developing the voice department and trauma-informed\, a
 nti-racist curriculum. She also leads workshops at universities\, scores f
 ilms\, creates sound installations\, and is the Category Content Specialis
 t for Synthesizers at KORG USA. In 2025\, she was invited to serve on Expe
 rimental Sound Studio’s first-ever Artist Advisory Council\, supporting 
 the development of new online programming for artists in electronic and so
 und art.\n\n \n\nPROGRAM\n\nTBA\n\n \n\nPARKING\n\nPlease plan to arrive e
 arly as parking on campus can be tricky. Learn more about parking and dire
 ctions to UNC-Chapel Hill’s campus.\n\nThis performance is part of the 2
 026-2027 Conversations in Modern Music series and is funded by the Jarosla
 v F. and Barbara S. Hulka Fund for Music in the Chapel Hill community.
GEO:35.911875;-79.054454
LOCATION:Kenan Music Building\, Rehearsal Hall
SUMMARY:TALsounds | CMM 26-27
URL;VALUE=URI:https://calendar.unc.edu/event/talsounds-cmm-26-27
CATEGORIES:Performances
END:VEVENT
