DESCRIPTION:Want to tell a story using images\, videos\, documents\, or oth
 er media from your research project? You can create and host a digital exh
 ibit fore free using CollectionBuilder! This workshop will cover how to se
 t up your own digital exhibit using CollectionBuilder and Google Sheets. A
 ttendees will learn how to add images\, PDFs\, videos\, and more to their 
 website. CollectionBuilder makes it easy to set up your own digital exhibi
 t with minimal technical expertise.\n\n \n\nThis workshop is offered by th
 e University Library and will be led by librarian Rolando Rodriguez and CA
 LA Shannon Henry. \n\n \n\nThis workshop is being offered remotely via Zoo
 m. Register here: https://calendar.lib.unc.edu/event/17236733
