DESCRIPTION:Celebrate Great Trails State Day by giving back to one of North
  Carolina's designated State Trails! Join volunteers as we remove litter f
 rom the Dan River and surrounding river access areas\, helping protect wil
 dlife\, improve water quality\, and keep the river beautiful for paddlers\
 , anglers\, and future generations. This cleanup is part of North Carolina
  the Beautiful\, the America 250 NC statewide cleanup initiative celebrati
 ng stewardship of our state's natural and cultural resources. Whether you'
 re on the water or along the shoreline\, every helping hand makes a differ
 ence.
GEO:36.383623;-79.957112
LOCATION:Downtown Madison River Park
SUMMARY:NC the Beautiful: Dan River Cleanup
