X-SOURCE-URLS:{"Events 1 Ics": "https://events.dncr.nc.gov/event/park-in-the-dark-3255"}
X-SOURCE-ID:events_1_ics
X-SOURCE:NC Cultural Resources
DTSTAMP:20260913T043426Z
UID:tag:localist.com\,2008:EventInstance_53939173370528
DTSTART:20261017T220000Z
DTEND:20261018T010000Z
DESCRIPTION:Have you ever wondered about the secret world of bats? Join Haw
  River State Park for the 6th annual Park in the Dark\, a thrilling evenin
 g of family fun as we discover the fascinating world of bats! Come hit the
  trail with us and enjoy bat themed activities\, crafts\, and learn more a
 bout these amazing nocturnal creatures. Bring your curiosity and get ready
  to explore the park trails at nighttime.  \n\nPark in the Dark runs from 
 6:00 p.m.- 9:00 p.m. on October 17\, 2026.\n\nCostumes Encouraged!\n\nMost
  of our activities will be along a one-mile trail. The hike is easy to mod
 erate\, with a few up and down hills. Be sure to wear appropriate footwear
  for safety.\nFlashlights recommended.
