BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE-ID:gcal_lgbtqcenterofdurham_org_qb71v8n48d0a304sq7dtm89f84
SUMMARY:Get Shit Done - SQSN
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20261020T173000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20261020T183000
DTSTAMP:20260913T043357Z
UID:22e6gq5sqd3lb3c1c8pvl5euq7_R20260915T213000@google.com__20261020
SEQUENCE:0
CREATED:20260803T141014Z
DESCRIPTION:<b>This event is intended for Queer and/or Trans survivors:</b
 ><br><br>Some of the biggest barriers to survivor safety are finance relat
 ed. While we do our best to put cash directly into survivors hands\, in ta
 ndem\, we thought it would be awesome to create a body doubling/coworking 
 space where we can support each other in sifting through all the shit that
  goes into getting financial stable. And offer relevant financial resource
 s as we find them!<br><br>That’s why we host our “Get Shit Done” eve
 nings. They will occur the 1st &amp\; 3rd Tuesday of each month and be ava
 ilable in person or online (must <a href="https://forms.gle/oJrgDoueQ6wCX
 Ku16" target="_blank"><u>register </u></a>or email <a href="mailto:advoc
 ate@lgbtqcenterofdurham.org" target="_blank"><u>advocate@lgbtqcenterofdurh
 am.org</u></a> for the virtual link). <br><br>If you or someone you know
  is a money expert who wants to share their knowledge with queer/trans sur
 vivors\, please reach out!
LAST-MODIFIED:20260827T005945Z
LOCATION:114 - living room
STATUS:CONFIRMED
TRANSP:OPAQUE
X-SOURCE:LGBTQ Center of Durham
END:VEVENT
