DESCRIPTION:Hey! Do you like to ride your bike on Wednesdays?<br><br>Come 
 hang out &amp\; ride bikes each 1st and 3rd Wednesday of the month at a ca
 sual paced no-drop social ride. 10-15 miles in a loop around Chapel Hill/C
 arrboro. Mostly on paved surfaces. We'll end at food/beer.<br><br>Meet at 
 Carrboro Town Commons @ 7pm\, roll out 7:30 (dm if ur late).<br><br>Don't
  forget lights and anything else you may need (helmet\, water\, spare tube
