DESCRIPTION:Join the arts learning team at the North Carolina Arts Council 
 for a free\, dynamic\, hands-on professional development session designed 
 for PK–8 educators. Discover how arts integration can deepen student lea
 rning across all subjects and bring fresh energy to your classroom.\n\nThe
  interactive session will feature:\n\nModel lessonsCollaborative activitie
 sPractical strategies you can apply immediatelyFacilitators will also shar
 e additional resources and professional development opportunities offered 
 through the Arts Council to support the inclusion of the arts in schools.\
 n\nWe are accepting applications from September 1 to October 12\, 2026.\n\
 nLunch will be provided. Participants will receive a certificate of attend
 ance.
