DESCRIPTION:Join a ranger for a 1.5 mile hike along the Rumbling Bald Loop 
 for a peaceful evening in Chimney Rock State Park. At certain spots along 
 the way\, participants will stop\, turn off their lights\, listen\, and le
 t nature's sounds prevail for a truly immersive experience in nature. You 
 will also have the chance to learn about (and hopefully observe) crepuscul
 ar wildlife in the park. Bring water\, comfortable shoes\, and a headlamp 
 or flashlight.
GEO:35.446778;-82.216898
LOCATION:Chimney Rock State Park - Rumbling Bald Access
SUMMARY:Silent Hike
URL;VALUE=URI:https://events.dncr.nc.gov/event/silent-hike-2761
