SUMMARY:Heritage Business Alliance | In Person
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261026T050000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261026T060000
UID:fbf19be75574d5622a614e1eb26c783c@growthzone.com
DESCRIPTION:The Heritage Business Alliance will gather for its quarterly i
 n-person meeting\, bringing Heritage businesses together for conversation\
 , collaboration\, and continued work on the Alliance's priorities. Wake Fo
 rest Commissioners Nick Sliwinski and Keith Shackleford will join us for a
  discussion focused on the experiences and needs of our Heritage business 
 community\, including current challenges\, policy changes\, and opportunit
 ies for local elected officials to better support\, partner with\, and adv
 ocate for Heritage businesses. The meeting will also include regular HBA b
 usiness\, updates\, and continued development of the Alliance's plan of wo
 rk and upcoming priorities. This is intended to be an open working convers
 ation so please come ready to share what you are seeing\, what your busine
 ss needs\, and where stronger connections or partnerships could make a dif
 ference.
LOCATION:Wake Forest\, NC
URL:https://chambermaster.wakeforestchamber.org/events/details/heritage-bu
 siness-alliance-in-person
X-SOURCE:Wake Forest Chamber of Commerce
END:VEVENT
