DESCRIPTION:Integrated into the ArcGIS Online platform\, the StoryMaps feat
 ure allows users to make informative\, map-based webpages without any codi
 ng! Examples can be found here.\n\nThis hands-on\, guided workshop will fo
 cus on creating StoryMaps with an array of mixed media – photos\, videos
 \, maps\, and more! By the end of the workshop\, attendees will be able to
  create their own beautiful\, interactive StoryMaps with pre-existing mate
 rials.\n\n \n\nNote: While everyone is welcome to join this workshop\, we 
 can only facilitate access to ArcGIS Online for UNC-Chapel Hill affiliates
 .\n\n \n\nThis workshop is offered by the University Library and will be l
 ed by librarian Philip McDaniel. \n\n \n\nThis workshop is being offered r
 emotely via Zoom. Register here: https://calendar.lib.unc.edu/event/172290
 33
LOCATION:
SUMMARY:Introduction to ArcGIS StoryMaps
URL;VALUE=URI:https://calendar.unc.edu/event/introduction-to-arcgis-storyma
 ps-2326
CATEGORIES:Workshops and Classes
END:VEVENT
