BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE-ID:gcal_41d85e1478a55e3b4adbf2e4951c5be9f6e49241ac55a65427c71d252849bf1c
SUMMARY:No Tyranny Tuesdays: Raleigh Brier Creek
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20261103T160000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20261103T173000
DTSTAMP:20260913T043349Z
UID:3feab4l4s1qbjuk8eq5c5k91ci@google.com__20261103
SEQUENCE:3
CREATED:20251010T141943Z
DESCRIPTION:<span><p>Please join Engaged Defenders for Democracy every Tue
 sday 3:30-5:00 pm at Brier Creek on corner with Starbucks: 7854 Alexander 
 Prom Pl\, Raleigh\, NC 27617\; please park at Walmart.</p><p>This will be 
 a POSITIVE and nonviolent demonstration. We are here to protect our democr
 acy. We are standing up for what we believe in. We want to inspire people 
 to join us and grow our movement!</p><p>Please bring positive signs only. 
 Some examples: Instead of "Stop defunding science" Say "Protect Research" 
 "Immigrants make us stronger" "Housing for all" "Healthcare for all" "Save
  the planet"</p><p>Make signs about what you're standing up for -- whether
  that is the libraries\, DEI\, healthcare\, women’s rights</p><p>Please 
 no mocking signs\, no swastikas</p><p>We are excited to see you there and 
 stand together for our country!</p><p>See you every Tuesday engaging drive
 rs at Brier Creek in Raleigh.</p><p>Please join our Substack:<span> </spa
 n><a href="https://substack.com/profile/115484101-engaged-defenders-4-demo
 cracy">https://substack.com/profile/115484101-engaged-defenders-4-democrac
