 ose with a basic familiarity with statistics. These seminars introduce top
 ics not often included in STATS 101.\n\n \n\nIn this seminar Jeff Laux\, P
 hD\, will discuss how variables can be selected for inclusion in statistic
 al models.\n\n \n\nRegister\n\n \n\nPlease note: This seminar will not be 
 recorded and materials will be shared during the seminar or with documente
 d attendees only. Attendance may be gathered from Zoom attendance reports.
