UID:65jh9jvfsnn18ge9mkcp67emkd@google.com__20261125
SEQUENCE:1
CREATED:20260108T022109Z
DESCRIPTION:Please join Engaged Defenders for Democracy every Wednesday at
  N. Roxboro &amp\; Latta in North Durham from 7:30-8:30am. There is a CVS 
 that opens at 8am. There is also other convenient parking.\n\nThis will be
  a POSITIVE and nonviolent demonstration. We are here to protect our democ
 racy. We are standing up for what we believe in. We want to inspire people
  to join us and grow our movement!\n\nPlease bring positive signs supporti
 ng the movement and resisting what is happening in our country!\n\nPlease 
 no mocking signs\, no swastikas\n\nWe are excited to see you there and sta
 nd together for our country!\n\nSee you every Wednesday morning engaging d
 rivers in Durham!\n\nPlease join our Substack: <a href="https://www.google
 .com/url?q=https://substack.com/profile/115484101-engaged-defenders-4-demo
 cracy&amp\;sa=D&amp\;source=calendar&amp\;usd=2&amp\;usg=AOvVaw3y7Kv9RwiMP
 WcPPUFQih9k" target="_blank">https://substack.com/profile/115484101-engage
