DESCRIPTION:FEATURING\n\nUNC Symphony Orchestra\, directed by Dr. Evan Harg
 er\nwith\nJuan Álamo\, percussion\nRafael Rodriguez\, flute\nArmando Rami
 rez\, Composer-In-Residence\nGuest conductor Claudio Cohen\, Maestro Titul
 ar e Diretor Artístico da Orquestra Sinfônica do Teatro Nacional Claudio
  Santor\n\n \n\nPROGRAM\n\nArmando Ramirez  Concerto for Percussion and Fl
 ute\, featuring Juan Álamo and Rafael Rodriguez\nPyotr Illyich Tchaikovsk
 y  Capriccio Italien\n\n-Intermission-\n\nHeitor Villa-Lobos  Bachianas Br
 asileiras No. 7 with Guest Conductor\, Claudio Cohen\n\n \n\nTICKETS\n\n$1
 0 general admission\n$5 students\, faculty\, and staff\nFree UNC Music stu
