DESCRIPTION:Come enjoy the beauty of a 19th century Christmas aglow with ca
 ndlelight. This holiday season\, you are invited to tour the home of John 
 and Amy Harper decorated for Christmas. Enjoy period music\, cider by a wa
 rm fire\, a festive wagon ride\, a soldiers camp\, plus crafts and activit
 ies. Do not miss your chance to experience Christmas by candlelight at Ben
 tonville Battlefield!
