DESCRIPTION:Join us for the Christmas Open House at the CSS Neuse Museum th
 is holiday season! 🎄✨ Everyone is invited to enjoy stunning Christmas
  lights\, yummy cookies 🍪\, fun crafts\, and exciting activities on Thu
 rsday\, December 17th\, from 10:00 am to 3:00 pm. \n\nDiscover the history
  behind beloved holiday traditions and create your own Victorian Christmas
  card and ornament 🎁—perfect keepsakes to cherish forever! Don’t mi
 ss out on this festive celebration!\n\nSome of the activities for the day 
 include:\n- Create a Victorian Christmas Card 🎄✨\n- Create a Victoria
 n Christmas Ornament 🎁🎀\n- Christmas-themed puppet show provided by 
 the New Bern Puppets 🎭🎅\n- Holiday-themed book and craft activity 
 📚✂️\n- Victorian parlor games and more! 🎉🎲\n- Visitors can al
 so take fun photos with Santa! 🎅📸\n\nRegular Admission: $5+tax for A
 dults\; $4+tax for Senior Citizens and Veterans\; $3+tax for Students\; Fr
 ee for Ages 3 and under.\n\nIf you have any questions\, please contact Rac
 hel by calling 252-526-9600\, ext. 222\, or by email at rachel.kennedy@dnc
 r.nc.gov.
GEO:35.260403;-77.581573
LOCATION:CSS Neuse Civil War Museum
SUMMARY:Cookies and Crafts: Christmas Open House 
URL;VALUE=URI:https://events.dncr.nc.gov/event/cookies-and-crafts-christmas
 -open-house-960
CATEGORIES:Exhibits & Tours
CATEGORIES:Special Site Programs
END:VEVENT
