DESCRIPTION:Revueltas: Sensemayá* Gabriela Montero: Piano Concerto No. 1\,
  “Latin”* Beethoven: Symphony No. 7 *evening performances only \n\nEnj
 oy a season-long festival celebrating the genius of Beethoven as Music Dir
 ector Carlos Miguel Prieto leads the Symphony and special guest artists in
  5 extraordinary concerts!\n\nNorth Carolina SymphonyCarlos Miguel Prieto\
 , conductor Gabriela Montero\, piano*
GEO:35.77126;-78.639608
