 \n$10 general admission\n$5 students\, faculty\, and staff\nFree UNC Music
  students\, faculty\, and staff\n\n$5 live stream\n\nPurchase tickets or l
 ivestream registration online. Tickets are also available at the door\, 30
  minutes prior to the concert start time.\n\n \n\nPARKING\n\nPlease plan t
 o arrive early as parking on campus can be tricky. Learn more about parkin
 g and directions to UNC-Chapel Hill’s campus.\n\nThis event is part of t
 he 2026-2027 Martha Flowers Ensemble series.
