  hits—“Free Fallin’\,” “American Girl\,” “I Won’t Back Dow
 n\,” and more—to life with powerful orchestral sound and driving rock 
 energy. \n\nNorth Carolina Symphony Brent Havens\, conductor
GEO:35.77126;-78.639608
LOCATION:Meymandi Concert Hall
SUMMARY:The Music of Tom Petty with the North Carolina Symphony
