BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"Meetup Triangleai": "https://www.meetup.com/triangleai/events/253138119/"}
X-SOURCE-ID:meetup_triangleai
X-SOURCE:Meetup: Triangle AI
UID:event_253138119@meetup.com
SEQUENCE:1
DTSTAMP:20260913T043405Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20301106T183000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20301106T203000
SUMMARY:Building an AI powered\, global scale messaging system with XMPP &
 Deep Learning
DESCRIPTION:Triangle AI Meetup\nThis talk is an in-depth look at XMPP\, th
 e open standard for real-time messaging\, and how to build a global scale\
 , AI enhanced messaging system using XMPP. We’ll explore EJabberD\, the 
 massively scalable\, open-source XMPP server that powers in-game chat for 
 Eve Online\, and examine how to: combine XMPP with WebRTC for real-time au
 dio/video calling\, add AIML to build helpful chatbots\, and how to incorp
 orate Deep Learning to categorize messages in real-time. After the talk\, 
 you’ll know how to use XMPP and Ejabberd to build anything from a help-d
 esk chatops application\, to a globe spanning in-game messaging system.
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/triangleai/events/253138119/
STATUS:CONFIRMED
CREATED:20180725T180622Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20180725T180622Z
CLASS:PUBLIC
END:VEVENT
END:VCALENDAR